Z||000000||BAM-BAM||11-14-2001||10:58 PM||||Just looking into the future a little...OK! ALOT!!!! But when I get ready; and I will get ready, who, what, when, where and how do I go about getting my 85GT Targa'd??? I have seen a couple on line and thought that it was definitely the look for the notchbacks with the Aero fascia's. I prefer T-Tops on the fastbacks. Anyway, something that I know will probably take a while to research, so any info would help. Even if I had to go to a custom top maker, I just need to know where to go and who to speak to. TIA and LMK<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000001||AusFiero||11-15-2001||12:20 AM||||The top would be the easy bit Bam Bam. The chassis has to be reinforced when you remove they top section as it adds strength. I am going to chop the top off my t-topped car and make it into a convertible. I have a few ideas on how I am going to reinforce it.||||reg||1
