Z||000005||mrfixit58||11-16-2001||09:37 AM||||If you want to see what one looks like, do a search on "Cozmo". He has a targa and has posted a few pictures. At our club meeting this week, I met one of the partners of the company who make the convertible conversion kits for Fieros. He has worked a deal with Cozmo to duplicate the targa hard-top and -- hopefully -- start to offer it as a kit. <P>Stay tuned,<P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||6
